So, my OpenNLP part is kinda done, but for now it is not perfect at all and not connected with the GUI, there is the demo version of it (i made my own GUI right there)

Instruction:
- clone this repository
- add plugins to the folder "External Libraries" (see below)
- run NLPGuiAPP.java
- insert the URL for your web-page
- click "load text"
- when it will be uploaded, then close the new window with "success"
- now you can see annotated sentences
- click "analyze' below the "input text"
- then you can search whatever you want with the "search type" and "query"
- now you can see search results


In External Libraries there should be added "opennlp-tools-2.5.4.jar" and "opennlp-tools-models-2.5.4.jar"
